{0pt}未\hspace{0pt}執\hspace{0pt}行\hspace{0pt}測\hspace{0pt}地\hspace{0pt}線\hspace{0pt}普\hspace{0pt}查\hspace{0pt}、共\hspace{0pt}軛\hspace{0pt}判\hspace{0pt}定\hspace{0pt}、原\hspace{0pt}始\hspace{0pt}根\hspace{0pt}判\hspace{0pt}定\hspace{0pt}、數\hspace{0pt}值\hspace{0pt}實\hspace{0pt}驗\hspace{0pt}或\hspace{0pt}路\hspace{0pt}線\hspace{0pt}圖\hspace{0pt}評\hspace{0pt}分\hspace{0pt}。綜\hspace{0pt}合\hspace{0pt}結\hspace{0pt}果\hspace{0pt}支\hspace{0pt}持\hspace{0pt}一\hspace{0pt}項\hspace{0pt}受\hspace{0pt}限\hspace{0pt}架\hspace{0pt}構\hspace{0pt}：兩\hspace{0pt}個\hspace{0pt}曲\hspace{0pt}面\hspace{0pt}可\hspace{0pt}採\hspace{0pt}用\hspace{0pt}各\hspace{0pt}自\hspace{0pt}專\hspace{0pt}屬\hspace{0pt}的\hspace{0pt}精\hspace{0pt}確\hspace{0pt}證\hspace{0pt}明\hspace{0pt}產\hspace{0pt}生\hspace{0pt}器\hspace{0pt}，但\hspace{0pt}輸\hspace{0pt}出\hspace{0pt}必\hspace{0pt}須\hspace{0pt}進\hspace{0pt}入\hspace{0pt}共\hspace{0pt}同\hspace{0pt}的\hspace{0pt}語\hspace{0pt}義\hspace{0pt}憑\hspace{0pt}證\hspace{0pt}綱\hspace{0pt}要\hspace{0pt}，再\hspace{0pt}由\hspace{0pt}獨\hspace{0pt}立\hspace{0pt}驗\hspace{0pt}證\hspace{0pt}器\hspace{0pt}檢\hspace{0pt}查\hspace{0pt}。綱\hspace{0pt}要\hspace{0pt}須\hspace{0pt}分\hspace{0pt}離\hspace{0pt}完\hspace{0pt}整\hspace{0pt}群\hspace{0pt}共\hspace{0pt}軛\hspace{0pt}、最\hspace{0pt}大\hspace{0pt}根\hspace{0pt}與\hspace{0pt}原\hspace{0pt}始\hspace{0pt}性\hspace{0pt}、外\hspace{0pt}部\hspace{0pt}反\hspace{0pt}元\hspace{0pt}素\hspace{0pt}配\hspace{0pt}對\hspace{0pt}、自\hspace{0pt}互\hspace{0pt}反\hspace{0pt}性\hspace{0pt}、重\hspace{0pt}複\hspace{0pt}軌\hspace{0pt}道\hspace{0pt}、終\hspace{0pt}止\hspace{0pt}性\hspace{0pt}、完\hspace{0pt}備\hspace{0pt}性\hspace{0pt}，以\hspace{0pt}及\hspace{0pt}正\hspace{0pt}面\hspace{0pt}或\hspace{0pt}負\hspace{0pt}面\hspace{0pt}的\hspace{0pt}重\hspace{0pt}播\hspace{0pt}證\hspace{0pt}據\hspace{0pt}。共\hspace{0pt}同\hspace{0pt}語\hspace{0pt}義\hspace{0pt}不\hspace{0pt}要\hspace{0pt}求\hspace{0pt}共\hspace{0pt}同\hspace{0pt}的\hspace{0pt}內\hspace{0pt}部\hspace{0pt}演\hspace{0pt}算\hspace{0pt}法\hspace{0pt}或\hspace{0pt}數\hspace{0pt}值\hspace{0pt}表\hspace{0pt}示\hspace{0pt}。目\hspace{0pt}標\hspace{0pt}端\hspace{0pt}空\hspace{0pt}集\hspace{0pt}合\hspace{0pt}與\hspace{0pt}控\hspace{0pt}制\hspace{0pt}端\hspace{0pt}非\hspace{0pt}空\hspace{0pt}集\hspace{0pt}合\hspace{0pt}的\hspace{0pt}方\hspace{0pt}向\hspace{0pt}，均\hspace{0pt}僅\hspace{0pt}是\hspace{0pt}未\hspace{0pt}驗\hspace{0pt}證\hspace{0pt}的\hspace{0pt}繼\hspace{0pt}承\hspace{0pt}架\hspace{0pt}構\hspace{0pt}假\hspace{0pt}設\hspace{0pt}。若\hspace{0pt}日\hspace{0pt}後\hspace{0pt}分\hspace{0pt}別\hspace{0pt}以\hspace{0pt}來\hspace{0pt}源\hspace{0pt}與\hspace{0pt}假\hspace{0pt}設\hspace{0pt}充\hspace{0pt}分\hspace{0pt}的\hspace{0pt}證\hspace{0pt}明\hspace{0pt}記\hspace{0pt}錄\hspace{0pt}成\hspace{0pt}功\hspace{0pt}重\hspace{0pt}播\hspace{0pt}，才\hspace{0pt}可\hspace{0pt}把\hspace{0pt}相\hspace{0pt}應\hspace{0pt}方\hspace{0pt}向\hspace{0pt}作\hspace{0pt}為\hspace{0pt}條\hspace{0pt}件\hspace{0pt}式\hspace{0pt}的\hspace{0pt}產\hspace{0pt}生\hspace{0pt}器\hspace{0pt}輸\hspace{0pt}入\hspace{0pt}；在\hspace{0pt}此\hspace{0pt}之\hspace{0pt}前\hspace{0pt}，兩\hspace{0pt}端\hspace{0pt}差\hspace{0pt}異\hspace{0pt}不\hspace{0pt}得\hspace{0pt}支\hspace{0pt}持\hspace{0pt}空\hspace{0pt}與\hspace{0pt}非\hspace{0pt}空\hspace{0pt}比\hspace{0pt}較\hspace{0pt}、算\hspace{0pt}術\hspace{0pt}性\hspace{0pt}推\hspace{0pt}論\hspace{0pt}、A0/A1/A2 關\hspace{0pt}閉\hspace{0pt}、Route A 計\hspace{0pt}分\hspace{0pt}或\hspace{0pt} Route B 進\hspace{0pt}展\hspace{0pt}。P33-RC-1 的\hspace{0pt}七\hspace{0pt}項\hspace{0pt}義\hspace{0pt}務\hspace{0pt}仍\hspace{0pt}為\hspace{0pt}零\hspace{0pt}項\hspace{0pt}完\hspace{0pt}成\hspace{0pt}；產\hspace{0pt}生\hspace{0pt}器\hspace{0pt}、綱\hspace{0pt}要\hspace{0pt}、驗\hspace{0pt}證\hspace{0pt}器\hspace{0pt}與\hspace{0pt}普\hspace{0pt}查\hspace{0pt}均\hspace{0pt}未\hspace{0pt}實\hspace{0pt}作\hspace{0pt}。本\hspace{0pt}文\hspace{0pt}的\hspace{0pt}落\hspace{0pt}地\hspace{0pt}成\hspace{0pt}果\hspace{0pt}是\hspace{0pt}可\hspace{0pt}稽\hspace{0pt}核\hspace{0pt}的\hspace{0pt}憑\hspace{0pt}證\hspace{0pt}方\hspace{0pt}法\hspace{0pt}設\hspace{0pt}計\hspace{0pt}，而\hspace{0pt}不\hspace{0pt}是\hspace{0pt}已\hspace{0pt}完\hspace{0pt}成\hspace{0pt}的\hspace{0pt}科\hspace{0pt}學\hspace{0pt}普\hspace{0pt}查\hspace{0pt}、磁\hspace{0pt}流\hspace{0pt}或\hspace{0pt}行\hspace{0pt}列\hspace{0pt}式\hspace{0pt}結\hspace{0pt}果\hspace{0pt}，也\hspace{0pt}不\hspace{0pt}是\hspace{0pt} Route A 或\hspace{0pt} Route B 的\hspace{0pt}正\hspace{0pt}式\hspace{0pt}結\hspace{0pt}論\hspace{0pt}。
\par}

The two project objects originate in a substantial but heterogeneous literature. Nazarenko (2013)
% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U01 source_ids=P33-S01 anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S01}
 supplies the compact genus-two octagon-family and generator context from which the frozen control is drawn. Aigon-Dupuy et al.~(2005)
% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U02 source_ids=P33-S02 anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S02}
 provide peer-reviewed family-level context for genus-two hyperbolic octagons and Fuchsian descriptions. For the target, Aurich et al.~(1991)
% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U03 source_ids=P33-S05 anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S05}
 provide regular-octagon matrices, a length relation, and a periodic-orbit enumeration precedent, while Katz et al.~(2016)
% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U04 source_ids=P33-S08 anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S08}
 provide arithmetic-Fuchsian and quaternion-order context for the Bolza surface. Grácio and Sousa Ramos (2010)
% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U05 source_ids=P33-S09 anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S09}
 connect symbolic dynamics and fundamental-group words to genus-two length-spectrum computation. These contributions support objects and candidate-generation contexts; they are not treated as completed P33 owner censuses.

The target is similarly treated through bounded complementary context. Aurich et al.~(1991)
% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U10 source_ids=P33-S05 anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S05}
 provide regular-octagon periodic-orbit and matrix context, and Katz et al.~(2016)
% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U11 source_ids=P33-S08 anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S08}
 provide exact arithmetic and quaternion-order context for Bolza. Jenni (1984)
% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U12 source_ids=P33-S06 anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S06}
 remains PLAUSIBLE, page-unpinned, and context-only in the frozen verifier; it is not used here to assert an exact systole theorem or formula. Schmutz (1993)
% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U13 source_ids=P33-S07 anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S07}
 supplies broader extremal and systolic context without independently validating the project replay inequality. Thus object identity, arithmetic characterization, systolic context, and below-cutoff owner closure remain separate evidence surfaces.

Strohmaier and Uski (2013, corrected 2018)
% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U22 source_ids=P33-S16,P33-S16-CORR anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S16,P33-S16-CORR}
 illustrate a separation among bounded computation, error control, and completeness reasoning for spectral objects on hyperbolic surfaces; their 2018 correction is cited separately, remains confined to its recorded scope, and their determinant endpoint is outside P33. Johansson (2017)
% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U23 source_ids=P33-S17 anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S17}
 presents arbitrary-precision midpoint-radius arithmetic with explicit error radii. Rump (2010)
% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U24 source_ids=P33-S18 anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S18}
 surveys rigorous verification using floating-point computation. These works support proof-bearing enclosure discipline for appropriate numerical predicates, but interval arithmetic does not decide group conjugacy or primitivity.

Correction metadata is now dual-bound at every affected use while locator boundaries remain unchanged. The Takeuchi record retains its correction binding (Takeuchi, 1975)
% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U27 source_ids=P33-S03,P33-S03-CORR anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S03,P33-S03-CORR}
