% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U44 source_ids=P33-S05 anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S05}
, Katz et al.~(2016)
% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U45 source_ids=P33-S08 anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S08}
, and Grácio and Sousa Ramos (2010)
% ARS-CITE use_id=P33-U46 source_ids=P33-S09 anchor=none claim_to_passage=INCONCLUSIVE locator_disposition=EXPLICIT_BOUNDED_UNAVAILABLE
\citep{P33-S09}
 bound complementary target and candidate-generation contexts. No cited source is converted into a project-level full-conjugacy, maximal-root, inverse-pair, or completeness certificate.
